s defined in the workflow."}, {"question_id": "Q5", "question": "Beyond the summary text itself, are there required elements in the email such as a list of action items, owners, decisions made, or attached documents?", "answer": "Yes. The email is expected to include a list of decisions reached, tasks with their assigned owners, and any relevant supporting materials linked or attached. The note-taker also checks that every task has a clear owner before finalising the message."}, {"question_id": "Q6", "question": "Is there a target or maximum time limit within which the summary email must be sent after the meeting ends, and are there any consequences if that deadline is missed?", "answer": "No time limit or associated consequence for late delivery is mentioned in the workflow. This detail is not specified."}]}
